## BONUS: The "Checklist for the Checklist"

When you're stuck and don't know what to do:

```
☐ Is this SOLID?
☐ Is this loosely coupled?
☐ Is this RAII-safe?
☐ Is this exception-safe?
☐ Is this testable?
☐ Is this optimized (where it needs to be)?
☐ Am I over-engineering this?
☐ Would I be happy to maintain this code in 2 years?
☐ Would I be proud to show this to a senior developer?
☐ Does this code make me feel GOOD?

If you answered NO to any, fix it. If you answered YES to all, ship it.
```

